RadioTower_Interior4_Text_FatMan::
	.string "I listened to the radio while I was\n"
	.string "at the RUINS.\p"
	.string "I heard a strange broadcast there.$"

RadioTower_Interior4_Text_ScientistRichIntro::
	.string "Most excellent.\p"
	.string "This RADIO TOWER will fulfill our\n"
	.string "grand design.$"

RadioTower_Interior4_Text_ScientistRichDefeat::
	.string "Hmmm...\p"
	.string "All grand plans come with snags.$"

RadioTower_Interior4_Text_ScientistRich::
	.string "Do you honestly believe you can\n"
	.string "stop TEAM ROCKET?$"

RadioTower_Interior4_Text_TeamRocketExecutive5Intro::
	.string "Stop! I’m known as the TEAM ROCKET\n"
	.string "fortress!\p"
	.string "You’re not taking another step!$"

RadioTower_Interior4_Text_TeamRocketExecutive5Defeat::
	.string "The fortress came down!$"

RadioTower_Interior4_Text_TeamRocketExecutive5::
	.string "You’ve earned my respect, so here’s\n"
	.string "some advice.\p"
	.string "It’s not too late.\n"
	.string "You can still turn back.$"

RadioTower_Interior4_Text_TeamRocketGrunt34Intro::
	.string "You plan to rescue the DIRECTOR?\p"
	.string "That won’t be possible because I’m\n"
	.string "going to beat you!$"

RadioTower_Interior4_Text_TeamRocketGrunt34Defeat::
	.string "No! Unbelievable!$"

RadioTower_Interior4_Text_TeamRocketGrunt34::
	.string "I don’t believe it!\n"
	.string "I was beaten!$"

RadioTower_Interior4_Text_TeamRocketGrunt32Intro::
	.string "Don’t I think POKéMON are cute?\p"
	.string "I’ll think my POKéMON are cute...\p"
	.string "...after they beat yours!$"

RadioTower_Interior4_Text_TeamRocketGrunt32Defeat::
	.string "Oh, no! They’re so useless!$"

RadioTower_Interior4_Text_TeamRocketGrunt32::
	.string "I love my beautiful self!\n"
	.string "Who cares about POKéMON?$"

RadioTower_Interior4_Text_Beauty_1::
	.string "MARY: Why? Why do I have to suffer\n"
	.string "through this?\p"
	.string "MEOWTH, help me!$"

RadioTower_Interior4_Text_Beauty_2::
	.string "MARY: Please tune into me on PROF.\n"
	.string "OAK’s POKéMON TALK show.$"

RadioTower_Interior4_Text_Beauty_3::
	.string "MARY: Oh! You’re my little savior!\p"
	.string "Will you take this as my thanks?$"

RadioTower_Interior4_Text_Beauty_4::
	.string "MARY: It’s just right for POKéMON\n"
	.string "that know normal-type moves.$"

RadioTower_Interior4_Text_Meowth::
	.string "MEOWTH: Meowth...$"

RadioTower_Interior4_Text_Sign1::
	.string "4F PRODUCTION$"

RadioTower_Interior4_Text_Sign2::
	.string "4F STUDIO 2$"
